WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.059
Millions of people already have GTA 6.

00:00:04.059 --> 00:00:06.092
Nobody can play it.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.961
The entire game is sitting on millions of hard drives.

00:00:14.961 --> 00:00:15.853
No mod.

00:00:15.853 --> 00:00:16.745
No menu.

00:00:16.745 --> 00:00:18.083
No way in.

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:21.206
It is right there in their hands,

00:00:21.206 --> 00:00:23.436
and they cannot open it.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.358
Two hundred and twelve gigabytes — the biggest download ever.

00:00:28.358 --> 00:00:31.831
The download is finished and the folders are full.

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:34.532
But every file is scrambled into noise.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.320
So why lock it?

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.686
That's not security.

00:00:47.686 --> 00:00:48.596
That's theater.

00:00:48.596 --> 00:00:49.961
And it's brilliant.

00:00:49.961 --> 00:00:50.871
One lock,

00:00:50.871 --> 00:00:51.781
one countdown,

00:00:51.781 --> 00:00:56.332
every player in the world waiting for the same midnight.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.283
But what's inside the noise?

00:01:06.283 --> 00:01:08.066
Shine a light through it,

00:01:08.066 --> 00:01:10.562
and the shape of a city appears.

00:01:10.562 --> 00:01:11.988
That part is theory.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.321
At midnight,

00:01:25.321 --> 00:01:30.655
thirteen years unlock at once — the biggest simultaneous moment in gaming history.

00:01:30.655 --> 00:01:31.475
One minute,

00:01:31.475 --> 00:01:33.937
the game is a locked box.

00:01:33.937 --> 00:01:34.758
The next,

00:01:34.758 --> 00:01:37.220
the whole world is playing it.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.628
So the door is opening.

00:01:46.628 --> 00:01:48.331
What's your first move?

00:01:48.331 --> 00:01:50.885
Every locked door has a key.

00:01:50.885 --> 00:01:52.588
Follow for Part 2.

